verimark-linux (0.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Report a command the sensor refuses as a general error instead of a
    protocol error. fprintd turned the latter into enroll-disconnected,
    which Fingwit ignores, so a failed enrollment looked stuck at the last
    scan.
  * Log why an enrollment failed (sensor verdict or commit status).
  * Never report the last enroll stage before the sensor finishes.

